<% 
  const year = typeof currentYear !== 'undefined' ? currentYear : (typeof seo !== 'undefined' && seo.year ? seo.year : new Date().getFullYear());
%>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Best Universities for Medicine and Surgery in Nigeria (<%= year %> Guide)</title>
    
    <!-- ✅ SEO Meta Tags -->
    <meta name="description" content="Discover top universities in Nigeria to study Medicine and Surgery in <%= year %>. Compare UI, UNILAG, OAU, ABU, UNN, and UNIBEN medical school requirements.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="best universities for medicine, top medical schools in Nigeria <%= year %>, Medicine and Surgery universities, UI, UNILAG, OAU, ABU, UNN">
    <meta name="author" content="MySchoolGist">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/universities/medcine/surgry">

    <meta property="og:title" content="Best Universities for Medicine and Surgery in Nigeria (<%= year %>)">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Learn about top medical schools in Nigeria offering Medicine & Surgery with teaching hospital details and cut-off insights.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/images/medicine.jpg">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/universities/medcine/surgry">
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">

    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Best Universities for Medicine and Surgery in Nigeria (<%= year %>)">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Explore top Nigerian universities for Medicine and Surgery with detailed facility information.">

    <%- include('../includeFolder/_headers.ejs') %>
</head>
<body>
   <%- include('../includeFolder/hot_link_1.ejs') %>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Best Universities in Nigeria for Medicine and Surgery (<%= year %>)</h1>
        <p>Medicine and Surgery remains one of the most competitive and rewarding academic paths in Nigeria. Below are the top universities with fully accredited medical programs and world-class teaching hospitals.</p>
        
        <div class="university">
            <h2>1. University of Ibadan (UI)</h2>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Oyo State</p>
            <p><strong>Why UI?</strong> Premier medical school in Nigeria affiliated with the University College Hospital (UCH).</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="university">
            <h2>2. Obafemi Awolowo University (OAU)</h2>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Osun State</p>
            <p><strong>Why OAU?</strong> Renowned clinical training paired with the Obafemi Awolowo University Teaching Hospitals Complex.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="university">
            <h2>3. University of Lagos (UNILAG)</h2>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Lagos State</p>
            <p><strong>Why UNILAG?</strong> Strong clinical infrastructure partnered with Lagos University Teaching Hospital (LUTH).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="university">
            <h2>4. Ahmadu Bello University (ABU)</h2>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Kaduna State</p>
            <p><strong>Why ABU?</strong> A premier northern institution boasting massive clinical facilities and high graduate capacity.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="university">
            <h2>5. University of Nigeria, Nsukka (UNN)</h2>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Enugu State</p>
            <p><strong>Why UNN?</strong> Excellence in medical research and practical surgery training at UNTH.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="university">
            <h2>6. University of Benin (UNIBEN)</h2>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Edo State</p>
            <p><strong>Why UNIBEN?</strong> Respected medical faculty affiliated with the University of Benin Teaching Hospital (UBTH).</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section-txt"> 
      <h2>Conclusion</h2>
      <p>Choosing the right institution for Medicine & Surgery in <%= year %> depends on cut-off scores, geographical location, and facility availability. Always verify that your target school maintains active accreditation with the Medical and Dental Council of Nigeria (MDCN).</p>
    </section>

   <%- include('../includeFolder/hot_link_2.ejs') %>
   <%- include('../includeFolder/_footer.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>